* NMOS and Voltage Sources

M1 2 4 6 6 NMOS  ; NMOS transistor with Drain (2), Gate (4), Source (6), and Body (6)

V1 4 3 DC 1      ; Voltage source of 1V connected between Net 4 and Ground (Net 3)
V2 2 5 DC 3      ; Voltage source of 3V connected between Net 2 and Ground (Net 5)
V3 6 3 DC 1      ; Voltage source of 1V connected between Net 6 and Ground (Net 3)

* End of Netlist